# Joint-space move with the firmware's per-axis S-curve (SDK Arm::movej).
#
# Blocks until the move finishes or the SDK's deadline expires. speed is a fraction
# of full speed, 0 < speed <= 1 -- 30 means 30x, not 30 percent; use
# set_speed_scaling for a percentage. Refused unless the node is started with
# allow_motion:=true.

float64[] q               # one target per axis, in joint order (joint1..jointN)
float64 speed
---
bool success
string message
